<alg_conf>

<!--
Configuration for the MAID2007 electromagnetic helicity amplitude model.

The default constants reproduce the validation notebook in
validation/maid_form_factor_validation using Drechsel, Kamalov, and Tiator,
Eur. Phys. J. A 34, 69 (2007), Tables 6-8 and 10-13.

Configurable Parameters:
.................................................................................................
Name                    Type    Optional Comment
.................................................................................................
AmplitudeSource         string  Yes      MAID2007, RSOriginal, or RSOriginalP33
RSQConvention           string  Yes      RSLab or QStar for RSOriginalP33
RSHelicityAmplAlg       alg     Yes      native RS EM helicity model for RSOriginal
RES-Omega               double  Yes      native RS FKR Omega for RSOriginal
RES-Zeta                double  Yes      native RS FKR Zeta for RSOriginal
RSOriginalPhase         double  Yes      phase for visible original-RS A/S curves
ApplyLuisWidthScale     bool    Yes      multiply A/S by sqrt(130/115), comparison only
LuisWidthScale          double  Yes      explicit scale value
DeltaMass               double  Yes      Delta pole mass used in MAID formulas
AM@P33(1232)            double  Yes      MAID2007 reduced magnetic A0
AE@P33(1232)            double  Yes      MAID2007 reduced electric A0
AS@P33(1232)            double  Yes      MAID2007 reduced scalar A0
BetaM@P33(1232)         double  Yes
BetaE@P33(1232)         double  Yes
BetaS@P33(1232)         double  Yes
GammaM@P33(1232)        double  Yes
GammaE@P33(1232)        double  Yes
GammaS@P33(1232)        double  Yes
DeltaS@P33(1232)        double  Yes
A12@P11(1440)-A0        double  Yes      MAID2007 Roper Eq. 5.19 coefficient
A12@P11(1440)-C1        double  Yes      MAID2007 Roper Eq. 5.19 coefficient
A12@P11(1440)-C4        double  Yes      MAID2007 Roper Eq. 5.19 coefficient
A12@P11(1440)-Beta      double  Yes      MAID2007 Roper Eq. 5.19 coefficient
S12@P11(1440)-A0        double  Yes      MAID2007 Roper Eq. 5.20 coefficient
S12@P11(1440)-C1        double  Yes      MAID2007 Roper Eq. 5.20 coefficient
S12@P11(1440)-C4        double  Yes      MAID2007 Roper Eq. 5.20 coefficient
S12@P11(1440)-Beta      double  Yes      MAID2007 Roper Eq. 5.20 coefficient
A12@Res-Has/A0/Alpha/Beta
                        mixed   Yes      MAID2007 Eq. 5.21 and Tables 7, 12
A32@Res-Has/A0/Alpha/Beta
                        mixed   Yes      MAID2007 Eq. 5.21 and Tables 7, 12
S12@Res-Has/A0/Alpha/Beta
                        mixed   Yes      MAID2007 Eq. 5.21 and Table 12
DipoleMass2             double  Yes      dipole mass squared in GeV^2
RSVectorMass            double  Yes      original RS vector mass for RSOriginalP33
-->

